==Russian==

===Noun===
'''люди''' (ljúdi) {{mpl}}

#[[people]]

===Usage note===
Normally only a plural. However, the singular [[люд]] exists in a single phrase:
:{{RUchar|[[рабочий люд|рабо́чий люд]]}} &mdash; ''workpeople''

